        {
            "id": "ann_1",
            "type": "note",
            "text": "UI Controls 3D Scene — Color & Camera\n\nColorPicker changes the sphere's material color.\nSlider controls the camera's Y rotation (orbit).\n\nData flow:\n  UI widgets → PanelTOP (CHOP port 1) → ScriptCHOP\n  ScriptCHOP reads chop() channels and calls set_par()\n  to write color → GeometryCOMP and rotation → CameraCOMP.\n\nThe control panel and 3D render are composited into\na single output window.",
